        <mxCell id="qL7YZ8iXrWiyFCGCVi6l-473" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Translate this from Chinese to English:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;Chinese:““走吧烈烈。”七月上来拉走了烈烈。&lt;br&gt;English:““Let’s go, Li Lie.” July pulled Li Lie away.&lt;br&gt;Chinese:““我们要不要领任务啊七月姐？”落落问。&lt;br style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;English:&lt;/font&gt;Do we want to take a mission, Sis July?&quot; Luo Luo asked.&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Chinese:“领。”七月决然地说”&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;English:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=left;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
