        <mxCell id="qL7YZ8iXrWiyFCGCVi6l-739" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot; style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color); font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Translate this from English to Chinese :&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ]&lt;/b&gt;English:PC culture letd vote fraud in Mu&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;slim areas flo&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;urish&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ]&lt;/b&gt;Chinese:电脑文化使“选举舞弊”盛行穆斯林地区&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ]&lt;/b&gt;English:Currently, a voter merely has to state their name and address.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ]&lt;/b&gt;Chinese:目前，选民只&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;需报出自己的姓名和地址即可。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center; font-size: 20px; line-height: 110%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;...&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ]&lt;/b&gt;English:Give police powers to set up cordons around polling stations.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 20px; line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;[&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ]&lt;/b&gt;Chinese:授权警方在投票站周围设立警戒线。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=left;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4591.82" y="12280" width="605" height="232.12999999999988" as="geometry" />
