        <mxCell id="qL7YZ8iXrWiyFCGCVi6l-740" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;Translate this from English to Chinese : &lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;[&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ]English:It was just incredible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;[&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ]Chinese:这太令人难以置信了。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;[&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ]English:There&#39;s no better way to win it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;[&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ]Chinese:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;没有什么比这场胜利更棒了。&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center; line-height: 70%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;...&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px; border-color: var(--border-color);&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;[&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ]English:We all as a team came together in the last three months.&lt;br style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: var(--border-color);&quot;&gt;[&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ]Chinese:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px; border-color: var(--border-color);&quot; face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;我们在三个月前才刚刚组队。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=left;fillColor=none;html=1;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
